配，而且很注重擺盤。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snapinst.app_470917322_482754174841416_423307566337522767_n_1080_3381046267b6d602de24c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snapinst.app_470917322_482754174841416_423307566337522767_n_1080_3381046267b6d602de24c-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t長崎黑鮪大腹握壽司（圖片來源：IG@chuyusushi1201）\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snapinst.app_467513386_18467567386057693_4550272766632795272_n_1080_118183275467b6d64c4b04f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snapinst.app_467513386_18467567386057693_4550272766632795272_n_1080_118183275467b6d64c4b04f-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t黃寶石Ossetra魚子醬（圖片來源：IG@chuyusushi1201）\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snapinst.app_470160999_611282571467336_1792268275231727005_n_1080_49813473767b6d62159908.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snapinst.app_470160999_611282571467336_1792268275231727005_n_1080_49813473767b6d62159908-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t醬油漬卵釜飯（圖片來源：IG@chuyusushi1201）\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption></figure>\n<p><p>初魚</p><p>名稱：初魚（台北101購物中心）</p><p>地址：台北市信義區市府路45號4樓<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/AWx9Wock6rsHQu9k7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">(地圖按此)</a></p><p>電話：02-23660792 （訂座專線）</p><p>價格：NTD$1880+10%</p><p>營業時間：12:00 - 14:00 ； 17:30 - 21:30</p><p>#n#：</p></p>\n<p><a>回到目錄</a> <br/><a></a> </p